To use these files you will need perl and HOL Light.

- Download proofs.tar.gz from
  http://www.michaelbeeson.com/research/CheckEuclid/index.php
  and unpack it into a subdirectory "proofs".

- Move or copy the files "Definitions.txt" and "Theorems.txt"
  (generated by FreekFiles.php) out of the proofs
  subdirectory.

- Run the perl script "FreekFiles.pl".  This produces a file
  "michael.ml" from the prf files in the proofs subdirectory.

- Inside HOL Light load this file.  It will first load the
  file "proofs.ml" and then process all the converted proofs.
